e accommodation or adjustment during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, please visit https://amazon.jobs/content/en/how\\-we\\-hire/accommodations for more information. If the country/region you’re applying in isn’t listed, please contact your Recruiting Partner.\n   \n\n  \n\n  \n\n**Company** \n \\- ASSPL \\- Karnataka\n   \n\n  \n\n Job ID: A10533831"},{"title":"Functional Test Lead","company":"Northern Trust Corp Ltd","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-09-09","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/functional-test-lead-northern-trust-corp-ltd-bengaluru-pune-10-13-years-jobid-VARsGmRaRzJzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"10-13 Yrs","is_walkin":false}]